      "step": 2,
      "name": "串記劇本",
      "minutes": 2,
      "content": "清晰：lucid、explicit、perspicuous、transparent。晦澀：obscure、opaque、ambiguous、equivocal（voc 族已練）、vague、abstruse、recondite。用對打一次記兩排。"
    },
    {
      "step": 3,
      "name": "詞卡 round",
